 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Previously, back at the communal apartment, Arkady and young Lyosha gathered wooden clothespins to make a toy shooter while neighbor Klavdia Viktorovna shouted warnings from her doorway. Meanwhile, at Ivan Samsonov's flat, Nina finds her depressed husband drinking cold vodka alone, having completely given up on his mayoral campaign.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Вот хорошая ты баба. Холодная.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "В смысле, водка хорошая.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Какие у тебя планы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Пить буду. Дома сидеть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Гениальные планы! Очень полезные.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "А у тебя другие предложения есть?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Успокоить жену! Подготовиться и поехать на дебаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Не зря в народе говорят.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Яблоко от яблони недалеко падает!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Что ты такое говоришь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Твой дед в войну родину предал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А ты сейчас свою семью предаёшь!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Не надо мне мораль читать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Твой дед полицаем стал из страха.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А ты алкоголиком становишься. Счастливо!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's unpack the bitter confrontation between Nina and her defeated husband.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Холодная.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Cold.' Samsonov makes a drunken joke, comparing the chilled vodka to a woman.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "В смысле, водка хорошая.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I mean, the vodka is good.' He clarifies his clumsy words with a sigh.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Какие у тебя планы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What are your plans?' Nina demands to know if he has any intention of fighting back.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Пить буду. Дома сидеть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will be drinking. Sitting at home.' He admits his total defeat and surrender.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Гениальные планы! Очень полезные.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Brilliant plans! Very useful.' Nina uses biting sarcasm to shake him awake.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Успокоить жену! Подготовиться и поехать на дебаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Calm your wife down! Get ready and go to the debate.' She lays out a clear path forward.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Яблоко от яблони недалеко падает!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The apple does not fall far from the tree!' Nina invokes the famous proverb about family flaws.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Твой дед в войну родину предал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your grandfather betrayed his country in the war.' The historical rumor stings Samsonov deeply.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А ты сейчас свою семью предаёшь!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you are betraying your family right now!' She links the grandfather's failure to his drinking.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Не надо мне мораль читать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not lecture me on morals!' The colloquial phrase means to preach or scold.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "А ты алкоголиком становишься. Счастливо!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you are becoming an alcoholic. Goodbye!' Nina turns on her heel and leaves the room. Now listen to the argument between Nina and Ivan again.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
